%% Insight Hub — Ingestion (write path)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Adm as Admin
  participant PR as Probe
  participant MAIL as M365 / Google
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant MIN as MinIO
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant AI as AI Service
  participant QD as Qdrant

  Adm->>PR: connect mailbox source (admin consent / DWD)
  PR->>PG: store encrypted credentials/tokens
  Note over PR: scheduler fires (backfill OR incremental)
  PR->>PR: split mailbox set across workers (50 -> 5x10)
  PR->>MAIL: pull messages (delta / historyId)
  PR->>PG: dedup check (Message-ID + content hash)
  alt new message
    PR->>MIN: store raw .eml + attachments
    PR->>PG: store message/thread metadata
    PR->>MQ: enqueue "process" job
    MQ->>AI: deliver job
    AI->>MIN: read attachments
    AI->>AI: parse (Tika/unstructured) + OCR + lang detect
    AI->>AI: chunk + embed (BGE-M3)
    AI->>QD: upsert vectors + ACL payload
    AI->>AI: summarize email -> roll up thread summary
    AI->>PG: store summaries (JSONB)
  else duplicate
    PR-->>PR: skip (idempotent)
  end
  AI->>PG: write audit + metering events
